── Provenance ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

All source in this repository is original work written for this project.

No code was copied from any third-party repository. Two projects linked from
the Hedera x402 bounty page were read as *technical reference* — for protocol
facts such as package names, header names, network identifiers and message
ordering — and are credited here for that reason:

  * matevszm/x402-hedera-example
    Read for protocol facts only. At the time of review (2026-07-22) this
    repository carried NO LICENSE file, so no code from it may be copied, and
    none was. Facts about a public protocol are not copyrightable expression.

  * hedera-dev/scaffold-hbar (branch: templates/x402-pay-per-use)
    MIT licensed. Read for structure and dependency facts. No code copied; if
    any is adopted later, the MIT notice will be reproduced here.

The `@x402/hedera` package and the Hedera Consensus Service are used through
their public interfaces. They are dependencies, not vendored code.

── Runtime dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

At CP-H1 this project has ZERO third-party runtime or development
dependencies. It runs entirely on the Node.js standard library.
